<h1 class="font-bold text-4xl">About</h1>
<div class="pt-6 text-lg space-y-4">
  <p>I'm Miguel Torres, a software developer based in Valencia, Spain. I work mostly with Ruby and JavaScript, and I care about building things that work well and last long.</p>
  <p>Since 2026 my main work is <a href="https://dedukta.com/" class="text-ctp-blue hover:underline">Dedukta</a>, where I'm the founder. Dedukta recovers the Mexican tax invoices (CFDI) that businesses never receive for expenses they already paid. You send a photo of the receipt on WhatsApp, and Dedukta requests the invoice from the merchant until it arrives.</p>
  <p>This site is where I share what I learn along the way. You'll find it on the <a href="<%= relative_url('/posts') %>" class="text-ctp-blue hover:underline">blog</a>.</p>
  <p>Mickey Codes, S.L.U. is my company. The best way to reach me is <a href="mailto:<%= site.metadata.email %>" class="text-ctp-blue hover:underline"><%= site.metadata.email %></a>, or you can find me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/miguel-torres-a8717a88/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ctp-blue hover:underline">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://github.com/mickeytgl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ctp-blue hover:underline">GitHub</a>.</p>
